{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53938","headline":"五言四韵奉赠河西大德 · 太奉","name":"五言四韵奉赠河西大德","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"{喁左爲禹}{喁左爲禹}空门客，洋洋艺行全。\n解投天上日，不住[□□]禅。\n飞锡登云路，抠衣拂戍烟。\n喜同清净教，乐我太平年。\n（同前。\n原署：「报圣寺内供奉沙门太奉。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太奉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}